			"notes": "Seasons Mod v1.0.0\n\nThis mod introduces a dynamic cycle of Spring, Summer, Autumn, and Winter to the game, altering foliage, weather, and block behaviors over time.\n\nFeatures:\n\n- Foliage and grass colors transition automatically with the seasons (including evergreens like Spruce).\n\n- Custom seasonal particles: Cherry blossoms in Spring and falling leaves in Autumn.\n\n- Water freezes and snow accumulates on the ground during Winter.\n\n- Snow and ice gradually melt during Spring using an optimized system to maintain server performance.\n\n- Season data is saved server-side and synced to clients, complete with chat announcements.\n\n<img width=\"854\" height=\"480\" alt=\"2026-04-16_14 57 07\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/5e2ad3e2-0c66-41cb-a123-9db359b18da1\" />\n<img width=\"854\" height=\"480\" alt=\"2026-04-16_14 55 47\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/70fc639e-cc2e-44bd-a7b9-0dcc51388238\" />\n<img width=\"854\" height=\"480\" alt=\"2026-04-16_14 09 59\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/f7fcdc8f-f0f0-4e25-b1a1-82b4b3d8850b\" />\n<img width=\"854\" height=\"480\" alt=\"2026-04-16_14 08 23\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/2a0ea54e-287a-4a7a-873a-b0c8fa90b65f\" />\n<img width=\"854\" height=\"480\" alt=\"2026-04-16_14 07 52\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/094b4bad-68e8-4db5-8da6-0c29fd255cff\" />"
